{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おすっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/6873466/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月2日(ｏ'∀'人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、セカンドシングル「おいでシャンプー」発売日。おめでとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指原さんのソロデビュー「それでも好きだよ」も発売日です！おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デイリーチャート1位をとることができました(ノ_・。)(ノ_・。)みなさまのおかげです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おいでシャンプー」は初夏らしくて可愛い歌やからたくさんの方に聴いてほしいな...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「狼に口笛を」はめっちゃダンスがかっこいいくて、みんなの表情に感動します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イオンツアーが始まったよ。今日ななは埼玉のイオンモール与野さんにお邪魔して、握手会！たたたたたたのしかった。今日に握手できるなんて幸せや！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の中いっぱいの方に来ていただいて嬉しかったです！風邪ひかんで下さいね(ｏ'∀'人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読むん楽しすぎるーーーー！(ｏ'∀'人)thank you  thank you  thank you"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/6873466/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}